==English==

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/ˌmɛθ æmˈfɛt əˌmin/|/ˌmɛθ æmˈfɛt əˌmɪn/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|in|ɪn|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|meth|amphetamine|lang=en}}; 1945-50.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A highly addictive [[phenethylamine]] [[stimulant]] [[drug]], similar to cocaine. Its systematic (IUPAC) name is (S)-N-methyl-1-phenylpropan-2-amine.

